WEBVTT

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.290
This belongs to Master Katakura!

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.840
What's going on here, Dragon Man?

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.340
My second-in-command was
being held captive by the Toyotomi,

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.510
but now, he's been snatched
by this bastard named Matsunaga,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.680
He's apparently waiting for me up ahead,

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.880
Is he after Number One's swords again?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.890
More like, why's he alive?!

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.810
Ogre of the Western Sea, I'll leave
these guys under your command,

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.640
Attack Osaka as planned,

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.190
I'll rush over there as soon
as I get things squared away,

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.260
Number One!

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.900
We'll come, too!

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:34.490
Hold it.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.730
Eh?

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.160
He's one tricky bastard,

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.700
You know him?

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.570
Matsunaga Hisahide,

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:48.370
I've got some so-called
history with him, too,

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.000
How about it?

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:56.750
Why don't you let me, Chosokabe
Motochika, back you up on this?

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.800
Ah-ah, I'm not saying you
can't handle this on your own,

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:02.000
Just saying it'll be faster that way,

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:05.470
Besides, the Toyotomi knows
full well that the Date are coming,

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:06.520
but those fellas don't know yet

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.140
that the Ogre of the
Western Sea's still alive and kicking,

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.720
This lineup's a rare opportunity
to upset that wild monkey's plans

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.560
and breach their defenses,

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:20.690
It'd be a bit of a waste to break it
up on account of Matsunaga's meddling,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.700
Don't you think so?

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.950
So do it,

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.750
You've got a point,

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:34.290
One-Eyed Dragon of Oshu,,,

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:37.210
I imagine that in all likelihood,
you will be coming here,,,

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.170
It will be yet another source of
amusement to marvel at the Dragon

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.680
as he is brought low by a spot of mischief,

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.600
Ah, deception,

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.910
It's no use! These guys are tough!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.120
Time to run! We don't stand a chance!

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.670
Go! Go!

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:41.090
Brilliantly executed, Master Musashi!

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:45.380
Now is not the time for uncertainty,

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:54.690
Everybody, beat them to a pulp!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.820
Did you see that?! My signature
extra large bait and ambush!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.240
Hey! No running!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.990
Sit tight and get beat up!

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.240
Guys, after them!

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.920
This troop movement...

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.210
That is...

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.720
...the Mori Army!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.390
Wait, Master Musashi!

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.050
Ultimately, our opponent
is a school of small fry,

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.310
Nothing but insignificant and weak troops,

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:41.140
Sweep them away, Children of the Sun!

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.060
Eh?!

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.860
You guys play dirty! You copied my move!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:02.540
So, Lord Mori's come, just as expected,,,

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:12.590
Stop this!

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:16.680
What are you doing?!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.730
These people are not soldiers!

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.850
If you, too, are warriors,,,

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.430
Why you!

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:28.440
Damn it!

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.530
I want to go home!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.200
Wait for me, O-Kayo!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:46.340
Yukimura, our opponents
are men, just as we are.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:51.290
Never forget that as you wield your spears.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.220
My lord, that is exactly why...

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:59.050
It is precisely those thoughts that
now sap the strength from my spears.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.640
None of this should come as a surprise.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:11.110
And yet, my uncertainty holds
my soul captive and I am helpless...

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.030
M-My lord,,,

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:44.270
Master Yukimura!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.150
What?! A naval force has?!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:52.990
This is bad!

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.520
Lord Shimazu is still
recovering from his wounds

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.660
and he is alone on the southern beach!

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.910
Let's see now...

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:13.550
Suppose I'll let ya have a taste o' my blade!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:19.880
Take that!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.980
If ya ain't too yellow, come 'n get me!

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.860
Lord Shimazu!

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:41.580
So this is,,, Ogre Shimazu's,,, Jigen Style,,,

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.130
I will not permit you to set
foot upon the land of Satsuma!

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:08.730
I judged it would be easily done,

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:12.280
if we used their simpleminded
ambush tactic against them,

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.900
but they fight well for a ragtag force,

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.650
Soon, a separate Toyotomi detachment

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:20.950
is sure to be sent this way
from the northern end of Kyushu,

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.660
With orders to bury
me along with Satsuma,

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.610
Go, my sacrificial pawns,

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:30.000
Your deaths will pave the way to my victory,

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:41.550
Holy! He invited us!
What kind of welcome is this?!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.930
Time to fly, you sons of bitches!

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.510
Th-There's no way, Boss!

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:51.720
Say that after you've tried it!

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.430
That's right!

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:18.050
Let's take this in one shot!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.220
Are you ready?!

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:22.300
That's what I call a silly question!

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.680
So you're Matsunaga,

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:32.890
I hear you were real nice
to my guys a while back, too,

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:34.570
Long time no see,

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:37.270
Here I am, just like
I promised way back when,

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.730
Well, well,

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.740
The One-Eyed Dragon of Oshu
and the Ogre of the Western Sea,

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.660
Where's Kojuro?!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:47.700
I am sorry, but the
Right Eye of the Dragon,,,

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.870
,,,is not here,

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:14.270
Your dedication is greatly appreciated,

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.990
Lord Matsunaga left the
dear boy Katakura here,

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:32.120
It seems one of his personal effects
was sufficient for Matsunaga's needs,

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:34.620
That was convenient for us, too,

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.670
Because upon unification
of the land of the rising sun,

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.290
I intend to have the dear
boy Katakura join the ranks

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:43.300
of the force that will pry open the world,

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:46.800
Uesugi is trying to contain
the force at Utsunomiya,

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.720
It seems Kasugayama is now defended

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:51.300
by the supposedly neutral Maeda Army,

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:55.390
His wife customarily accompanies him,
but she has remained in Kaga,

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.600
Iikely because of the dear boy Keiji,

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:59.360
We can leave them be,

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.900
We must merely seize this opportunity
to take up our position in Odawara

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.110
before the Takeda make their move,

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:04.950
Yes,

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:09.240
Though, either way, the Takeda
won't be able to attack Odawara,

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.200
The Takeda, along with the Uesugi,
will be attacked from the rear

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.080
by the army we have hiding in the far north,

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.960
I'll head to Harima

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:20.410
and relieve the Mori Army of
that fortress, which has been rebuilt,

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:23.630
We'll have the dear boy
Motonari make his exit soon,

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:26.130
Regardless of whether he's
continuing to fight in Satsuma

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:29.810
or he's doubling back with
news of the completed fortress,

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.980
his luck will run out shortly,

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.930
We'll have the unrest in Satsuma quelled

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:39.690
by the man commanding the army
we sent to the northern end of Kyushu,

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.890
Our rock-solid preparations will be bolstered

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.270
by the overwhelming force we've trained,

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.150
This is how we, the
Toyotomi, wage war, Hideyoshi,

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.950
Mm,

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.400
We head for Odawara,

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.030
That's strange,

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.490
Where'd it go?

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:06.630
Yumekichi, was it you?

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:10.510
Did you play a prank on me while
I was asleep and hide it somewhere?!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.840
That charm is important to me, Yumekichi!

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.890
Kasuga!

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.770
Maeda Keiji, the Toyotomi
are making their move,

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:24.650
--What?
--It seems they are
mobilizing their main army,

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:26.600
They may have gotten wind
of the Uesugi's movements

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:30.940
and intend to occupy Odawara
before the Takeda can attack,

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:34.150
So they plan to subdue the Kanto
region in one fell swoop after that,

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:36.160
Which means this is,,,

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:43.710
Sorry, Kasuga, but take care
of Yumekichi for me for a while,

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:45.880
What?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:49.930
I just can't take you this time,

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:52.630
It'll be okay, Yumekichi,

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.590
I'll come back for sure.

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:57.390
Have I ever lied to you?

00:12:57.480 --> 00:13:00.140
Pinky swear, Yumekichi,

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:12.940
The battle in Satsuma had
once again settled into a standoff.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:16.330
Shimazu Yoshihiro's
unexpected entry into the fray

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:21.040
thwarted the Toyotomi-Mori Army's
planned pincer move with the navy.

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.120
And with Mori Motonari's desertion,

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.420
they were left without a commanding officer,

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.170
forcing them to temporarily retreat.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:32.000
Y'all hung in there good,

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.710
I reckon our enemy's
waitin' on reinforcements,

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:37.930
Let the troops take
turns restin' while we can,

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.230
Yes, Sir!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:41.310
Ya fought real fine out there,

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.310
What?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:46.020
Ya showed me what the
tiger cub o' Kai's really made of,

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.850
Nothing could be further from the truth,

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.860
It was merely desperation,,,

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.280
All that is in the hearts
of those I strike down,,,

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:54.780
To bear that burden and
move forward is something I,,,

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.080
Ya needn't resolve to bear the burden

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:59.410
o' all that's in the hearts o' those ya kill,

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:04.370
What? Do you mean to say
that it would be conceited?

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:07.460
The way ya are now, yes,

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:10.920
What've ya honed yer
skills for all this time?

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:12.130
What?

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.630
To distinguish yerself in battle,

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:16.430
That's fine for starters,

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.510
For starters, mind ya,

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:22.940
I'm bettin' that the
Tiger o' Kai himself's asked ya this,

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.480
Asked ya, what yer lookin' ahead to,

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:30.730
I'm the greatest!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:35.940
Musashi here's got an unwaverin' core
that he's also unwillin' to compromise,

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.620
He wants to be known as the greatest,

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.960
He lives single-mindedly for that,

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.410
Ain't a shred o' doubt there,

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.410
So he ne'er hesitates,

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:49.090
Back in the day, I fought like
crazy without really knowin', too,

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.760
But now, I wield this sword o' mine,

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:55.300
'cause I want to make this world
a place where young'uns can live

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.470
with some small smidge
o' hope in their hearts,

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.680
Each 'n every one o' us with our
own domains in these turbulent times

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:03.060
have similar ambitions,

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:05.730
Find yerself, Master Yukimura,

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:08.780
What's right 'n what's wrong

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:12.600
tends to change with
where ya decide ya stand,

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.490
It's only when you
stare fixedly at the future

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.440
that even injustices become just,

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.740
That's the way of these turbulent times,

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:25.960
Decide what ya want here, 'n the
path ya oughta take'll show itself to ya,

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:29.160
Then you'll ne'er hafta be
uncertain in yer heart o' hearts,

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.920
I was able to wield my spears by
your side because I was determined

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:38.880
to protect the future of these people
fighting with their backs to the wall

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:43.390
after being driven from their
homes and drifting here to Satsuma,

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:48.720
This land of clear, blue, open skies,
gentle waves, and radiant sun,,,

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:51.280
I wanted peace for this
land as soon as possible,

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:55.400
Yes, I remember now,,,

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:57.620
After the deeds of valor,,,

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.860
After these turbulent times are tamed,,,

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.620
What do I wish to accomplish?

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:05.950
What do I wish for the
land of the rising sun?

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:11.710
Lord Masamune, Mori Motonari,
and Toyotomi Hideyoshi,,,

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.420
And even my lord himself,,,

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:19.300
They all fight with unshakeable
aspirations in their hearts,

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.600
That is why they do not waver,

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:24.180
No, even if they do waver,
they can overcome it,

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:29.980
It was no wonder that I was
unable to win against Lord Masamune,

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:32.900
Ya go stop Mori Motonari,

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:36.100
--What?
--He's plannin' on challengin' Toyotomi,

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:41.570
Take my men in place o' the
subordinates ya lost at Itsukushima,

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.950
But Lord Shimazu, if I do,,,

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.700
A partin' gift,

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.950
No need to worry 'bout me,

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:52.250
This Shimazu's Jigen Style bladework
can take on a thousand foes,

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.210
B-But, Sir,,,

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:58.010
A partin' toast,

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:03.800
Don't cha lose that kind heart,

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:06.730
Those with kind hearts
agonize 'bout this 'n that,

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:08.800
They make a lotta mistakes, too,

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.310
That's why they take forever to get strong,

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:16.110
But those who become
truly strong in the end

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:19.660
are men like ya, with warmth right here,

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:21.150
Get goin' now,

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:25.530
I know ya can become the greatest
warrior in the land o' the risin' sun!

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.240
Lord Shimazu,,,

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:55.150
This is our chance!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:58.570
Fortress Sun, attack!

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.650
The hour of the sun's ascension is upon us!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.250
Hanbei.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.160
What is it, Hideyoshi?

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.960
Once we conquer this country, rest a while,

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:13.450
What?

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:16.710
Did you think that I had not noticed?

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:19.540
I need you,

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:28.980
Hideyoshi, those words alone
are all I could have ever wanted.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.830
Master Takenaka!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.320
What is the matter?!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:50.700
Call the doctor! And notify
Lord Hideyoshi as well!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.000
Don't...

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:54.870
There's no need for that,

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:01.290
I'll be fine after I rest a little.

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:04.550
You men head for Harima as planned,

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.550
I'll be right behind you,

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:07.930
B-But, Sir!

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:10.350
That's an order,

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.840
Y-Yes, Sir,

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.140
Time,,,

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.850
Just a little longer,,,

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:27.570
I see.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.570
So the great fortress is
bringing up the rear from the west,

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:34.120
As we'd suspected, Hideyoshi
must be headed for Odawara,

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.500
With Uesugi's movement in
mind, they mobilized promptly,

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.920
I guess I've got to hand it to them,

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.920
Which means, it's unlikely
they have no one to the north,

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.630
They just might still have a force in Oshu,,,

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.970
No, further back than that,

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:55.140
The force headed out to
rendezvous with Mori's fortress, huh?

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.140
Notify our lord for me,

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.600
I've got a little job to do,
then I'll head right back, too,

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:03.150
Also, I'll have to check on
Master Sanada's movements,

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.730
Takeda's ninjas,,,

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:09.070
So the latest model doesn't explode?

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:09.950
Hey there,

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:10.660
Whoa!

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:11.950
Long time no see,

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:14.160
Do not scare me, Sarutobi Sasuke!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.540
You're a ninja! Don't get
scared over every little thing,

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:19.790
Don't you need to head back
to Echigo to make your report?

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:21.590
I have sent some of my people,

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:23.630
Besides, there is
something that is bothering me,

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:26.130
Toyotomi's detachment that headed west,,,

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:29.050
,,,didn't include Takenaka Hanbei, right?

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:30.130
Yes,

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:33.590
I totally thought he'd be taking
command of things over there, too,

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:39.140
How about you hand over
at least one of those things?

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:40.390
One of what?

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.650
The flying ninja tool your people are using,

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.690
You made even more improvements on it,

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.490
You must be joking,

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:50.110
We're not really allies or anything right now,

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.740
You're as naïve as ever,

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.620
I risked my life to
contribute to its development!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.320
Shh!

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.620
One of Toyotomi's personal spies?

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.920
What is going on? Who would have,,,

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.710
That was,,,

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:19.350
So that's it,

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.180
That's Toyotomi's main army,

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.140
They've got to be headed for Odawara,

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:26.600
Which means that Matsunaga
bastard was in league with Toyotomi,

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:27.810
Who knows?

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:32.530
I doubt he'd join forces with
someone for little reward,

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:34.830
But more importantly, what do
you wanna do, One-Eyed Dragon?

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:37.250
The wild monkey's out to
take over the Kanto region,

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.670
Duh, It's obvious, isn't it?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.160
We chase after him and crush the bastard,

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:45.800
The rival warlords were all...

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:49.720
...now headed for their
respective final battlegrounds.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.090
Aiming for the pinnacle of the era,

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.670
the blades rising up in
chaos howl to one another.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:06.440
My dear Katakura,

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:10.110
the remaining time
allotted to you grows short,

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:45.250
Peace is not mindless tranquility!

00:23:45.340 --> 00:23:45.540
Only those who can face any
and all adversity without buckling

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:51.750
and stoke the fire in their hearts
will achieve all that they desire!

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:55.630
Therefore, next time,
my spirit will surge again!
